></sub></td><td align="center">31.46%</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T7"><label>Table 7</label><caption><p>Descriptive Statistics of the parameter estimates from the WLS methods for the MM.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="center" colspan="10"><bold>Sample parameter estimates for the 40 Subjects</bold></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center"><bold>Parameter</bold></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>0</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>1</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>2</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>3</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>4</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>5</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>6</bold></sub></td><td align="right"><bold>b</bold><sub><bold>7</bold></sub></td><td align="center"><bold>S</bold><sub><bold>I</bold></sub></td></tr><tr><td colspan="10"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="center"><bold>Values</bold></td><td align="right">13.415</td><td align="right">0.016</td><td align="right">0.061</td><td align="right">6.59E-06</td><td align="right">0.425</td><td align="right">5.091</td><td align="right">0.136</td><td align="right">618.82</td><td align="right">30.00</td></tr><tr><td align="center"><bold>SD</bold></td><td align="right">2.605</td><td align="right">0.016</td><td align="right">0.107</td><td align="right">1.11E-05</td><td align="right">1.428</td><td align="right">1.362</td><td align="right">0.065</td><td align="right">311.51</td><td align="right">148.48</td></tr><tr><td align="center"><bold>CV (%)</bold></td><td align="right">19.42</td><td align="right">98.91</td><td align="right">174.90</td><td align="right">168.85</td><td align="right">335.99</td><td align="right">26.75</td><td align="right">47.43</td><td align="right">50.34</td><td align="right">494.99